{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation progress: reproduced the no-common-ancestor tracker split in a regression test. The first attempted comment now refuses before creating a new local commit, preserving the previous HEAD. Confirmed make worktree does not create an independent tracker clone in the normal path: linked code worktrees symlink .tickets-tracker to the main worktree's shared tracker. Documented that fsck-recover preserves dangling ticket commits from stale rebase/merge recovery, but unrelated live local histories require isolated operator recovery/tracker-maintenance while other writers are quiesced."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788800117410426001,"uuid":"b41957cc-66fc-41cb-a01f-d5340eafdf09"}